  "goodToKnow": "Die Strafverfolgung is criminal prosecution or law enforcement. In Germany, it's the job of the Staatsanwaltschaft (public prosecutor's office), working with the police. German prosecutors are bound by the Legalitätsprinzip: they must investigate any suspected crime they learn of. Strafverfolgungsbehörden are law enforcement agencies. Verfolgen means to pursue or persecute. It has no plural."
